              </li>
              <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link" href="editorial.html">Editorial</a>
              </li>
              <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page"

                  href="#">Novels</a> </li>
              <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link" href="art.html">Art</a>
              </li>
              <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link" href="about.html">About</a>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <table style="width: 98%;" align="center" cellpadding="10" border="0">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td align="center">
            <div class="card" style="background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);">
              <div class="card-body">
                <div class="card mb-3">
                  <div class="row g-0">
                    <div class="col-sm-0 col-md-3"> <img src="altfantasy.png" alt="Adult Political Fantasy"

                        align="left" height="80"></div>
                    <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-9">
                      <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><i>The Lost Provider</i></h5>
                        <p class="card-text" align="left">Twelve years ago, a
                          group of insurgents kidnapped their prince in hopes of
                          ending their empire’s war against a rival. They only
                          vanished, and the war raged until their empire annexed
                          the territory. But rumors of a Robin Hood figure
                          leading a rebellion against the imperial forces are
                          the first lead a chronicler has had on his father who
                          went missing in the gambit all those years ago. He
                          crosses the sea in search of the truth and a way to
                          hold his government accountable. But his investigation
                          is precarious as his people are the oppressors and
                          that masked man is very, very hot. </p>
                        <p class="card-text"><small class="text-body-secondary">Status:
                            Seeking Representation</small></p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card mb-3">
                  <div class="row g-0">
                    <div class="col-md-3"> <img src="altfantasy.png" alt="Adult High Fantasy"

                        align="left" height="80"></div>
                    <div class="col-md-9">
                      <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><i>Arcane Enterprises</i></h5>
                        <p class="card-text" align="left">During an industrial
                          revolution fueled by the cyclical resurgence of magic
                          power, a gay investigator and a butch witch team up to
                          track down spell-casting criminals. However, given
                          that the witch is one of the people who can sense
                          magic and the investigator is one of those that
                          cannot, they have different opinions about what
                          constitutes a “crime.” A once in every three
                          generations burst of magical power is looming. They’ll
                          have to come to some agreement if they’re going to
                          help the inhabitants of the city when they learn the
                          institutions are working to protect their own
                          interests instead of the populace.</p>
                        <p class="card-text"><small class="text-body-secondary">Status:
                            Seeking Representation</small></p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card mb-3">
                  <div class="row g-0">
                    <div class="col-md-3"> <img src="altscifi.png" alt="Adult Hard SciFi"

                        align="left" height="80"></div>
                    <div class="col-md-9">
                      <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><i>The Vertebrate</i></h5>
                        <p class="card-text" align="left">The Ocean Worlds
                          Federation is considering allowing the recently
                          discovered human species into their fold. An engineer
                          considers themself incredibly lucky to be chosen as
                          the sole trial-run human on a planetary landing
                          expedition. They try to convince themself they are
                          still very lucky when the expedition's resupply
                          capsule gets lost in space and all their alien
                          crew-mates enact diapause protocols to survive. Alone
                          in counting calories, they still strive to deliver a
                          job performance that proves humanity's place among the
                          stars while grappling with what that even means.</p>
                        <p class="card-text"><small class="text-body-secondary">Status:
                            Work in Progress</small></p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card mb-3">
                  <div class="row g-0">
                    <div class="col-md-3"> <img src="altfantasy.png" alt="Adult Epic Fantasy"

                        align="left" height="80"></div>
                    <div class="col-md-9">
                      <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><i>The Most Wicked Thought</i></h5>
                        <p class="card-text" align="left">Every city has a god,
                          and the god rules their people with loving authority.
                          So loving and authoritive that a laundress keeps her
                          head down to avoid his attention. But as he guides
                          more and more of her neighbors into disastrous life
                          choices, she comes to a decision.<br>
                          She's got to fight him.</p>
                        <p class="card-text"><small class="text-body-secondary">Status:
                            Work in Progress</small></p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
